<title>FRANCE: Gaz et Eaux could up Danone stake.</title>
<headline>Gaz et Eaux could up Danone stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Gaz et Eaux could raise its stake in food group Danone, Gaz et Eaux chairman Bruno Roger said in an interview to appear in the next edition of weekly Journal des Finances on Saturday.</p>
<p>&quot;There are two areas I would like to strengthen: they are Saint-Gobain, in which we have 0.71 percent of the capital, and Danone. Gaz et Eaux could wish to raise its share in Danone,&quot; he was quoted as saying in an advance copy of the interview supplied to Reuters.</p>
<p>Gaz et Eaux currently holds 2.88 percent of Danone.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
